        },
        {
         "tex": "y^2 &= 4",
         "sym": "y**2 - 4"
        },
        {
         "text": "Since $y > 0$, $y = 2$ and $P = (-4, 2)$."
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "title": "Differentiate both sides with respect to $x$",
